  m_text: "<b>Reminder:</b>\nIf Mr. Sultan comes by, ask about his overdue payment.
    I haven\u2019t seen him in two weeks.\r\n\r\nAlso whoever\u2019s stocking the
    dairy section keeps disappearing. I asked for help twice and the boy just stood
    there staring. Weird day."
